New Idea:
I have found it hard for low-level characters to teleport levels.  Rings
of Tel. Cont. and dead Tengus are not easy to get.  My suggestion is to
implement an item (tool) called a Subway Token.  The item is applied to
a teleport trap, causing it to glow *color* or "--You hear a voice,  
"All Aboard"-- or something else clever.  Of course this uses up the
token.  When said character steps onto the trap, it acts as though 
he/she/it has tel. cont. (and is conf) enabling the character to
teleport levels!  The item can be made sufficiently rare/expensive
so the game isn't changed *too* much.
Maybe Tourists should start with one or two...

